{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625","id":470322332,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NzAzMjIzMzI=","number":44625,"title":"Updateable analyzers are not rejected when used as index time analyzers","user":{"login":"cbuescher","id":10398885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzk4ODg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10398885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher","html_url":"https://github.com/cbuescher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":142001965,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDIwMDE5NjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Search%20Relevance/Analysis","name":":Search Relevance/Analysis","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"How text is split into tokens"},{"id":1352927464,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzUyOTI3NDY0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/v7.3.0","name":"v7.3.0","color":"dddddd","default":false,"description":""},{"id":1434538947,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDM0NTM4OTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/v7.4.0","name":"v7.4.0","color":"dddddd","default":false,"description":""},{"id":3202334967,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjAyMzM0OTY3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/v8.0.0-alpha1","name":"v8.0.0-alpha1","color":"dddddd","default":false,"description":""},{"id":7049410381,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAAe_f88AAAABpC13TQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Search%20Relevance","name":"Team:Search Relevance","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for the Search Relevance team in Elasticsearch"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-07-19T13:23:33Z","updated_at":"2024-07-16T09:17:39Z","closed_at":"2019-07-19T16:15:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Analyzers that are only allowed to run at search time (e.g. because they are marked as \"updateable\") should not be allowed as regular analyzers on a field. E.g. the following should throw an error:\r\n```\r\nPUT /test\r\n{\r\n  \"settings\": {\r\n    \"index\": {\r\n      \"analysis\": {\r\n        \"analyzer\": {\r\n          \"synonym\": {\r\n            \"tokenizer\": \"whitespace\",\r\n            \"filter\": [\"synonym\"]\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        \"filter\": {\r\n          \"synonym\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"synonym\",\r\n            \"synonyms_path\": \"synonyms.txt\",\r\n            \"updateable\": true\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nPOST /synonym_test/_mapping\r\n{\r\n  \"properties\": {\r\n    \"text_field\" : {\r\n      \"type\": \"text\",\r\n      \"analyzer\": \"synonym\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nBut currently doesn't. The reason seems to be that we don't propagate the search mode correctly when wrapping it in a NamedAnalyzer. I'm working on a fix.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"cbuescher","id":10398885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzk4ODg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10398885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher","html_url":"https://github.com/cbuescher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbuescher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/44625/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}